{"id":"n41570-1-8","stage":5,"title":"네트워크 · 网络","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41570-1-8-1","ko":"네트워크가 연결이 안 된다고 뜨네.","zh":"显示说网络连接不上呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네트워크가","meaning":"网络","explanation":"네트워크：网络；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"네트워크","audio":"/audio/d09e977b090b10035431.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41570","senseId":"1","lemma":"네트워크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네트워크가","audio":"/audio/b4d2f75a17727eb3ee76.mp3"}},{"text":"연결이","meaning":"连接，连结","explanation":"연결：连接，连结；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연결","audio":"/audio/32dd2947e74266d57d4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13973","senseId":"1","lemma":"연결","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연결이","audio":"/audio/e6d12986623ed9e48579.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"된다고","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된다고","audio":"/audio/e2abef0fece7cab2d1ce.mp3"}},{"text":"뜨네.","meaning":"漂，浮","explanation":"뜨다：漂，浮；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜨네","audio":"/audio/cad749591cb1e2291837.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d09e977b090b1003","term":"네트워크","zh":"网络","audio":"/audio/d09e977b090b10035431.mp3","entryId":"41570","definition":"利用近距离通讯网或调制解调器等通信设备的计算机来相互连接的组织或体系。","pronu